| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes (`fact-10717d169571`, `fact-2cc55b3e4863`) | `PodScheduled`: False, reason: `Unschedulable`, message: `3 Insufficient memory`; phase: `Pending` | 确认调度失败现象，且归因于内存不足 |
