| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedScheduling` (fact-55939d69ffaa, fact-bf49aafb8005): `persistentvolumeclaim "unavailable-claim" not found` | 指出调度失败的直接原因：依赖的 PVC 不存在 |
