| 1 | K8s State | `kube-state-metrics` | `phase: "Pending"` | 确认 Pod `aiops-case-v03/workload` 处于等待调度的非运行状态 |
| 2 | K8s Config | K8s | `resource_request.cpu: "5m"`, `resource_limit.cpu: "50m"` | 展示容器的 CPU 资源边界，排除资源超卖或限制导致的内存/计算异常 |
