| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume "input" : secret "unavailable-input" not found` (fact-258ab1cb9337) | 核心根因证据：明确报错 Secret 缺失导致挂载失败 |
