| 1 | K8s Event | `fact-cdad2954f18f` | `Warning FailedMount 2m33s (x40 over 67m) kubelet MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume "input" : secret "unavailable-input" not found` | 证实挂载失败及缺失资源名 |
