| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `timed out waiting for the condition` (unmounted volumes=[input]) | 证明挂载卷因上述原因导致 Pod 无法继续调度进入运行状态 |
| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod 状态 `Pending`，容器 `app` 等待原因 `ContainerCreating` | 确认异常处于挂载卷处理阶段，容器未启动 |
