| 6 | K8s State | Kubelet | Pod status: `CrashLoopBackOff`, restart_count: `23` | 确认系统最终表现出的宏观状态 |
| 7 | Logging | App Log | `GET /health HTTP/1.1` 200 | 确认应用自身认为请求处理成功，但耗时极长 |
